-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §138 גמולים אשר ימשיכו להתקיים ברפורמה: the
-- management allowance of a kindergarten teacher at new rates — 17%, 20%,
-- 21% by management seniority for an existing teacher and by grade for a
-- new one — its other rules unchanged; and the education allowance as it
-- was.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `138 גמולים אשר ימשיכו להתקיים ברפורמה`

-- akn:art_138 The opening: the allowances paid to kindergarten teachers that go on, as (א)–(ב) set out.

-- (א)(1): the table. An existing teacher by her years of management —
-- "עד 5 שנים (כולל)", "6 עד 10 שנים (כולל)", "מעל 10 שנים", counted in
-- completed years (convention thresholds.seniority), so the rows meet — and
-- a new one by her grade — 1 to 2, 3 to 4, 5 to 9.
@ref akn:art_138__para_a akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p6 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p7 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p8 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p9 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p10 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p11 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p12 akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_1/p13
GIVEN `years of management` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` `years of management` IS
    BRANCH IF FLOOR `years of management` AT MOST 5  THEN 17%
           IF FLOOR `years of management` AT MOST 10 THEN 20%
           OTHERWISE 21%

GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new kindergarten teacher's management rate` grade IS
    BRANCH IF grade AT MOST 2 THEN 17%
           IF grade AT MOST 4 THEN 20%
           OTHERWISE 21%

-- (א)(2): the rest of the management allowance's rules, eligibility among
-- them, go on unchanged — an input here.
@ref akn:art_138__para_a__subpara_2
ASSUME `entitled to the management allowance by the existing rules` IS A BOOLEAN

-- (ב): the education allowance's rates and rules go on unchanged.
@ref akn:art_138__para_b akn:art_138__para_b/p2
ASSUME `the existing education allowance of a kindergarten teacher` IS A NUMBER

-- Every year of management and every grade has one rate, from 17% to 21%,
-- never falling as the years or the grade rise.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` y AT MOST `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` (y PLUS 1)) (range 0 30)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD `a new kindergarten teacher's management rate` g AT MOST `a new kindergarten teacher's management rate` (g PLUS 1)) (range 1 8)
#ASSERT `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` 5 EQUALS 17%
#ASSERT `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` 6 EQUALS 20%
#ASSERT `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` 11 EQUALS 21%
#ASSERT `an existing kindergarten teacher's management rate` 5.5 EQUALS 17%
